                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "It’s a short indie adventure, but that’s not a bad thing - it’s the kind of game where you’re meant to take your time, wander around the mansion, and let the eerie mood sink in. The puzzles are pretty simple, but they do a good job of giving you something to do while you explore.\n\nIt’s not going to blow you away, but for fans of the genre, it’s a solid little way to kill an evening. If you enjoy atmospheric adventure games and don’t mind a shorter experience, it’s worth a look.",
